&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5pt;"&gt;会社分割に伴う免責的債務引受契約を締結&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5pt;"&gt;役員兼任１名&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;資金の借入&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:39pt;min-height:39pt;"&gt;
